:[]},{"name":"Font","unit":"Vcl.Graphics","class":"TFont","properties":[]},{"name":"Margins","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TMargins","properties":[]},{"name":"Touch","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TTouchManager","properties":[]}]},{"name":"lblSubtitle","unit":"Vcl.StdCtrls","class":"TLabel","properties":[{"name":"Caption","value":"This demo shows the usage of number snippets. Number snippets let you retrieve the correct plural form of a localized string based on a number. For example, they can automatically choose between \"1 file\" and \"2 files\" according to the language's pluralization rules.","translations":[{"lang":"de","text":"Diese Demo zeigt die Verwendung von Zahlen-Platzhaltern. Zahlen-Platzhalter erm\u00F6glichen es, basierend auf einer Zahl die richtige Pluralform eines lokalisierten Strings abzurufen. Sie k\u00F6nnen zum Beispiel automatisch zwischen \"1 Datei\" und \"2 Dateien\" gem\u00E4\u00DF den Pluralisierungsregeln der Sprache w\u00E4hlen.","status":"Approved"},{"lang":"fr","text":"Cette d\u00E9monstration montre l'utilisation des fragments num\u00E9riques. Les fragments num\u00E9riques vous permettent de r\u00E9cup\u00E9rer la forme plurielle correcte d'une cha\u00EEne localis\u00E9e en fonction d'un nombre. Par exemple, ils peuvent choisir automatiquement entre \"1 fichier\" et \"2 fichiers\" selon les r\u00E8gles de pluralisation de la langue.","status":"Approved"},{"lang":"nl","text":"Deze demo laat het gebruik van number snippets zien. Number snippets laten u op basis van een getal de juiste meervoudsvorm van een gelokaliseerde tekenreeks ophalen. Ze kunnen bijvoorbeeld automatisch kiezen tussen \"1 file\" en \"2 files\" volgens de meervoudsregels van de taal.","status":"Approved"},{"lang":"pl","text":"To demo pokazuje u\u017Cycie liczbowych fragment\u00F3w. Liczbowe fragmenty pozwalaj\u0105 pobra\u0107 poprawn\u0105 form\u0119 liczby mnogiej zlokalizowanego ci\u0105gu na podstawie liczby. Na przyk\u0142ad mog\u0105 automatycznie wybra\u0107 mi\u0119dzy \"1 plik\" a \"2 pliki\" zgodnie z regu\u0142ami odmiany liczebnik\u00F3w w danym j\u0119zyku.","status":"Approved"}]},{"name":"HelpKeyword","value":""},{"name":"Hint","value":""},{"name":"StyleName","value":""}],"elements":[{"name":"Constraints","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TSizeConstraints","properties":[]},{"name":"Font","unit":"Vcl.Graphics","class":"TFont","properties":[]},{"name":"Margins","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TMargins","properties":[]},{"name":"Touch","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TTouchManager","properties":[]}]},{"name":"lblTitle","unit":"Vcl.StdCtrls","class":"TLabel","properties":[{"name":"Caption","value":"Number snippet demo","translations":[{"lang":"de","text":"Demo f\u00FCr Zahlen-Platzhalter","status":"Approved"},{"lang":"fr","text":"D\u00E9mo de fragment num\u00E9rique","status":"Approved"},{"lang":"nl","text":"Number snippet-demo","status":"Approved"},{"lang":"pl","text":"Demo liczbowych fragment\u00F3w","status":"Approved"}]},{"name":"HelpKeyword","value":""},{"name":"Hint","value":""},{"name":"StyleName","value":""}],"elements":[{"name":"Constraints","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TSizeConstraints","properties":[]},{"name":"Font","unit":"Vcl.Graphics","class":"TFont","properties":[]},{"name":"Margins","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TMargins","properties":[]},{"name":"Touch","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TTouchManager","properties":[]}]},{"name":"LocalizationEditor","unit":"VCL.TMSFNCLocalizationEditor","class":"TTMSFNCLocalizationEditor","properties":[{"name":"HelpKeyword","value":""},{"name":"Hint","value":""},{"name":"Version","value":"0.9.0.0"}],"elements":[{"name":"Margins","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TMargins","properties":[]}]},{"name":"Margins","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TMargins","properties":[]},{"name":"Padding","unit":"Vcl.Controls","class":"TPadding","properties":[]},{"name":"sbCount","unit":"Vcl.Samples.Spin","class":"TSpinEdit","properties":[{"name":"HelpKeyword","value":""},{"name":"Hint","value":